projects[3]:
  - id: skcc-ai-sdk
    name: "AI Layer iOS SDK"
    meta: "2025.01 – 2025.10 · SDK · Swift"
    tags[2]: platform:ios,lang:swift
    desc:
      en: "AI Layer iOS SDK — a shared AI-assistant screen embedded in SKT's T world and T membership apps, overlaying an AI layer on each app's webview."
      ko: "SKT T world·T membership 앱에 탑재된 공용 AI 화면 iOS SDK — 각 앱 웹뷰 위에 AI 어시스턴트 레이어를 제공."
    role:
      en: "Sole owner of the shared SDK — stabilization, requirement handling, releases, and release notifications."
      ko: "단독 SDK 안정화, 요구사항 반영, 배포 및 통지"
    work:
      en: "Improved iOS SDK accessibility and UI."
      ko: "iOS SDK 접근성·UI 개선"
    achievement:
      en[2]:
        - "Built a Slack notification workflow that alerts both consuming apps' teams on every SDK release, reducing integration surprises."
        - "Introduced MR templates to standardize code review."
      ko[2]:
        - "SDK 릴리스 시 사용 앱 팀에 자동 Slack 알림 체계 구축 — 연동 리스크 감소."
        - "MR 템플릿 도입으로 코드 리뷰 표준화."
    highlight:
      en: "Accessibility & UI improvements, MR template setup"
      ko: "접근성·UI 개선, MR 템플릿 구축"
    tech[3]: Swift,GitLab,Slack
    image: null
    links[0]:
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  User\n\n  subgraph Tworld[\"T world App\"]\n    subgraph WWebview[\"Webview\"]\n      WFE[\"T world FE\"]\n    end\n    WAIButton[\"AI Button\"]\n    WAISDK[\"AI Layer SDK\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Tmembership[\"T membership App\"]\n    subgraph MWebview[\"Webview\"]\n      MFE[\"T membership FE\"]\n    end\n    MAIButton[\"AI Button\"]\n    MAISDK[\"AI Layer SDK\"]\n  end\n\n  AISDKFE[\"AI Layer FE\"]\n\n  User --> Tworld\n  User --> Tmembership\n\n  WFE --> WAISDK\n  WAISDK <--> AISDKFE\n\n  WAIButton --> WAISDK\n\n  MFE --> MAISDK\n  MAISDK <--> AISDKFE\n\n  MAIButton --> MAISDK"
  - id: skcc-tworld
    name: "T world iOS"
    meta: "2024.10 – 2025.10 · Mobile · Swift"
    tags[2]: platform:ios,lang:swift
    desc:
      en: "SKT's customer-service B2C iOS app — webview-based."
      ko: "SKT 고객센터 B2C iOS 앱 - 웹뷰 기반"
    role:
      en: "iOS app maintenance and junior coaching."
      ko: "iOS 앱 유지보수, 주니어 코칭."
    achievement:
      en[3]:
        - "WKWebview delegate method had a force-unwrapped optional (!) causing 5,000+ crashes per week — traced via Firebase, reproduced the scenario, and fixed with a guard statement, eliminating all weekly crashes in one change."
        - "Widget sessions were blocked for customers using the security password feature — avoided a broad API rewrite by using App Groups-based CookieStorage to share the session between app and widget, giving customers 1-hour widget access after password entry and resolving a standing complaint."
        - "Set up a GitLab Runner with a local Ollama model to auto-review MRs and post comments, solving the non-technical manager's review bottleneck while keeping code off external servers — published a Medium article on the setup."
      ko[3]:
        - "WKWebview Delegate 메서드의 강제 언래핑(!)으로 주 5,000건 이상 Crash 발생 — Firebase로 추적 후 동일 상황 재현, Guard로 수정해 Crash 전량 제거."
        - "보안 비밀번호 고객의 Widget 미사용 문제 — API 수정 범위가 넓어 보류 중이던 건을 App Groups 기반 CookieStorage로 앱↔Widget 세션 공유해 비밀번호 입력 후 1시간 Widget 사용 가능하도록 해결, 민원 해소."
        - "Ollama Local 모델 기반 GitLab Runner MR 자동 검토 구성 — 비개발자 매니저의 검토 부담 해소 및 보안 유지, Medium 아티클 게재."
    highlight:
      en: "5,000+ weekly crashes eliminated"
      ko: "주 5,000건+ Crash 제거"
    tech[6]: Swift,Firebase,SPM,WKWebview,Ollama,Widget
    image: null
    links[1]:
      - label: "Medium: Automating MR Review on GitLab Using AI (Ollama)"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/automating-mr-review-on-self-hosted-gitlab-using-ai-ollama-932e1cab30d9"
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  User\n  Server\n  Web[\"Web\"]\n  AIWeb[\"AI Web\"]\n  ExFeature[\"External Feature\"]\n\n  subgraph iOS\n    subgraph App\n      subgraph Tab\n        Webview\n      end\n      Firebase\n      SPM\n      FeatureSDK[\"Feature SDK\"]\n      AISDK[\"AI Layer SDK\"]\n    end\n\n    Widget\n  end\n\n  User --> App\n  Web <--> Webview\n  App <--> Server\n  AISDK <--> AIWeb\n  ExFeature <--> FeatureSDK\n\n  App <--> Widget"
  - id: skcc-swing
    name: "SWING iOS"
    meta: "2024.06 – 2025.10 · Mobile · Swift"
    tags[2]: platform:ios,lang:swift
    desc:
      en: "Enterprise iPadOS Cordova hybrid app for SKT dealer management — SWING iOS maintenance and junior coaching (native Swift/ObjC shell over a SWING Web webview, backed by SKT Intra)."
      ko: "SKT 대리점 업무용 Enterprise iPadOS 앱 - Cordova 하이브리드 앱 SWING iOS 유지보수 및 주니어 코칭 — SKT Intra 기반, SWING Web 웹뷰를 네이티브 Swift/ObjC로 감싼 구조."
    role:
      en: "iOS app maintenance, process improvement, and junior coaching."
      ko: "iOS 앱 유지보수, 프로세스 개선, 주니어 코칭."
    work:
      en: "Upgraded the Xcode version; split work into units and assigned them to a junior."
      ko: "Xcode 버전 상향. 업무 분할 및 주니어 할당. "
    achievement:
      en[3]:
        - "Researched and shared a method to run an older Xcode on newer macOS."
        - "GitLab MRs had no descriptions, templates, or reviewers — introduced a template with intent, test steps, and results that auto-assigns default labels and a reviewer, speeding up manager approval, teaching juniors to collaborate, and spreading the practice to other freelance projects."
        - "After coaching, a junior took 80% ownership of SWING iOS."
      ko[3]:
        - "구버전 Xcode를 신규 macOS에서 실행하는 방법 연구 및 전파."
        - "기존 GitLab MR에 설명·템플릿·리뷰어가 없어 의도·테스트 방법·결과·기본를 가지고 Label·Reviewer 자동 설정하는 MR 템플릿 도입, 매니저 신속 승인·주니어 협업 교육·타 프리랜서 프로젝트에 전파."
        - "주니어 코칭 후 SWING의 80% 위임."
    highlight:
      en: "Junior coached to 80% ownership"
      ko: "주니어 80% 업무 위임"
    tech[6]: Swift,"Objective-C",Cordova,Firebase,SPM,GitLab
    image: null
    links[2]:
      - label: "Medium: Running Xcode 14 on Sonoma"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/running-xcode-14-on-sonoma-ccb627ee154c"
      - label: "Medium: Run Xcode 15.4 on Ventura"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/how-to-run-xcode-15-4-on-ventura-macos-break-os-limitation-07e181499da4"
